177
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:45,080
Four of the children were killed instantly

178
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:49,260
I did all that I could to protect the remaining four

179
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:52,240
But three of the children panicked

180
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:54,920
And didn't do as I instructed

181
00:10:54,920 --> 00:11:05,520
Rather than rely on me, they fled

182
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:09,080
