191
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:31,560
So it's no wonder the kids chose to run

192
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:34,900
Mr. Himejima is blind?

193
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,820
It was only the youngest girl, Sayo

194
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:41,300
Who against all her instincts listened to me in the moment

195
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:44,440
Sayo alone hid behind me

196
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:46,900
