197
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:51,100
So I fought

198
00:11:51,100 --> 00:11:54,380
I fought believing that no matter what

199
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:56,800
I had to protect Sayo with my life

200
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:59,340
No climate change

201
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:10,340
People have been

202
00:12:10,340 --> 00:12:12,540
Let it be

203
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,360
No

204
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,360
No

205
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,220
No

206
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:18,020
No

207
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:18,680
No

208
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:19,020
No

209
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:35,700
Striking a living creature in such a violent manner felt like hell to me.

210
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:41,100
I'll never forget how revolting that feeling was for as long as I live.

211
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:47,260
For the first time in my life, I was clenching my fist to throw punches with full force,

212
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:50,400
and my strength was terrifying even to me.

213
00:12:51,460 --> 00:12:58,640
Had that demon not attacked me, I would have gone my whole life never knowing how fearsome a strength I possessed.

214
00:12:59,900 --> 00:13:06,240
Again and again I continued to slam my fists against the demon's head until daybreak.

215
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:12,980
That night, I lost nearly everything, and my body was left broken.

216
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:17,300
I had risked my life to protect little Sayo.

217
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:22,740
When help arrived on the scene, this is what she told them.

218
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:25,820
That man is a monster.

219
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:27,980
He's the one who did it.

220
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,980
Who killed everyone.

221
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,960
No way.

222
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:36,960
The terror of that experience must have left her confused.

223
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:39,880
She was just a child of four after all.

224
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,740
Who could blame her for it?

225
00:13:42,540 --> 00:13:44,880
That's just the kind of creatures children are.

226
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:49,040
Despite what happened, I was desperate.

227
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,260
I needed Sayo to appreciate what I had done.

228
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:56,800
What I wanted to hear her say above all else was,

229
00:13:56,800 --> 00:14:00,380
Thank you for fighting for me.

230
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:06,620
I felt just hearing those words would have been enough to save me.

231
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:09,180
But these are children we're talking about.

232
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,800
All they can do is think of themselves.

233
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:15,680
The demon's corpse soon turned to dust and vanished.

234
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:19,380
All that remained were the bodies of the orphans I cared for.

235
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:24,660
Soon after the incident transpired, I was thrown into prison for murder.

236
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:28,540
If the Master hadn't intervened on my behalf,

237
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:30,820
I would have been executed at some point.

238
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:36,240
It's because of what happened that I became distrustful of nearly everyone around me.

239
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:40,020
Needless to say, I was suspicious of you, too.

240
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:43,580
Even the people who present themselves as being virtuous

241
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:46,560
