242
00:14:47,540 --> 00:14:49,920
But you, you never ran off.

243
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:52,040
You never turned your gaze away.

244
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:53,520
You never lied.

245
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:55,640
You were pure and single-minded.

246
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:58,720
