250
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:14,180
Thus, I cannot be wrong.

251
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:25,240
When it comes to what lies ahead, all of us hold our own doubts.

252
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:32,020
From now on, I, too, will help you, however I can, to guide you along your path.

253
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:39,140
I'll do my best.

254
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:41,740
Thank you for everything.

255
00:15:41,740 --> 00:15:41,800
Thank you for everything.

256
00:15:41,800 --> 00:16:04,100
All your training here with me is now complete.

257
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:27,380
Say what you will about him, but Mr. Himejima's a good guy.

258
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:33,540
He said I couldn't be his Tsukuko because I didn't have the talent.

259
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:37,660
But when he sensed I was eating demons, he made me his apprentice.

260
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:43,560
He even introduced me to Miss Kocho and had her check on my condition.

261
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,400
