269
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:06,240
No.

270
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:09,980
Actually, if it was anything, I'd say he would be starving.

271
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:12,540
Give it a rest already.

272
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:15,380
All you ever do is worry about other people.

273
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:20,240
You know, you seem to be pretty stubborn yourself, so I thought she'd give you a hard time.

274
00:17:20,840 --> 00:17:21,700
But she didn't.

275
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:23,180
So why did you get a pass?

276
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:28,760
Well, if I had no breathing techniques, I have a feeling I'd be in the same boat as you.

277
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:31,480
Oh, how are you physically, though?

278
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:35,840
